request.description:
Update driver activity status via PATCH /v1/drivers/:id/status.

Example body:
{
  "is_active": true
}

Expected response shape (200):
{
  "id": 2001,
  "is_active": true,
  "updatedAt": "..."
}

Accept trip via POST /v1/trips/:id/accept.

Example body:
{
  "driver_id": 2001
}

Expected response shape (200):
{
  "id": 501,
  "driver_id": 2001,
  "trip_status": "ACCEPTED",
  "accepted_at": "..."
}

Complete trip via POST /v1/trips/:id/complete.

Expected response shape (200):
{
  "trip": {
    "id": 501,
    "trip_status": "COMPLETED",
    "fare_amount": 136,
    "payment_status": "COMPLETED"
  },
  "payment": {
    "id": 701,
    "status": "COMPLETED",
    "amount": 136
  }
}

Cancel trip via POST /v1/trips/:id/cancel.

Expected response shape (200):
{
  "trip": {
    "id": 501,
    "trip_status": "CANCELLED"
  },
  "cancellation_fee": 0
}

Refund payment via POST /v1/payments/:id/refund.

Example body:
{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

Expected response shape (200):
{
  "id": 701,
  "status": "REFUNDED",
  "refund_amount": 136,
  "refunded_at": "..."
}
